@base = http://127.0.0.1:18101
@key = local-stripe-key
@admin = local-admin-key

### Create and authorise 25 EUR, but do not capture
POST {{base}}/v1/payment_intents
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}
Idempotency-Key: stripe-lesson-001
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

amount=2500&currency=eur&metadata[order_reference]=lesson-001&payment_method=pm_funded&confirm=true&capture_method=manual

> {% client.global.set("stripeId", response.body.id); %}

### Observe requires_capture
GET {{base}}/v1/payment_intents/{{stripeId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}

### Capture; rerun with this same key to prove replay
POST {{base}}/v1/payment_intents/{{stripeId}}/capture
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}
Idempotency-Key: stripe-capture-001

### Evidence: one RESERVE and one CAPTURE
GET {{base}}/__sim/payments/{{stripeId}}/ledger
X-Simulator-Admin-Key: {{admin}}

### Configure a post-commit response failure for the NEXT payment with this reference
PUT {{base}}/__sim/scenarios/lost-result-001
X-Simulator-Admin-Key: {{admin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"transientFailures":0,"loseResponse":true,"delayMs":0}

### First call returns 504; rerun IDENTICALLY to recover the saved successful result
POST {{base}}/v1/payment_intents
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}
Idempotency-Key: lost-result-001
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

amount=2500&currency=eur&metadata[order_reference]=lost-result-001&payment_method=pm_funded&confirm=true

### Business decline: no funds reserved
POST {{base}}/v1/payment_intents
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}
Idempotency-Key: low-funds-001
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

amount=2500&currency=eur&metadata[order_reference]=low-funds-001&payment_method=pm_low&confirm=true
